<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<catalogue xmlns="http://www.battlescribe.net/schema/catalogueSchema" id="f714ae22-fc81-51b0-bc0c-0951989c17b4" name="XIV Legion Death Guard" revision="7" battleScribeVersion="2.03" gameSystemId="86405571-5289-597b-b308-a9a2d68c00b9" gameSystemRevision="4" library="false">
 <selectionEntries>
 <selectionEntry id="ef76ae37-3ada-58f6-a5d9-c5406f815e56" name="Grand Cruiser" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="unit">
 <constraints><constraint type="max" value="3.0" field="selections" scope="roster" shared="false" id="9bcb6584-b03e-533b-9002-dc496c0e119f" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="true" /></constraints><profiles>
 <profile id="6a7f7fac-1fcd-572b-ab48-3e8bfd92da21" name="Grand Cruiser" hidden="false" typeId="806f9ff1-fd51-5ddb-b005-ce73a5d09d65" typeName="Ship">
 <characteristics>
 <characteristic name="BS" typeId="d130e705-611e-5a0a-bd7d-ea8e848fdb2e">3</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="Prow" typeId="84a55377-edbc-5825-a2bf-70c6155018f2">13</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="Side" typeId="5f595433-7397-5c4b-9d4a-8f35d83a2b29">12</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="Stern" typeId="cd9ec76e-f959-5560-8845-9ab242f16e71">11</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="HP" typeId="ef713781-2034-5fb4-83d1-e49d1d683694">9</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="VS" typeId="84309751-688d-50ef-8940-d8d042261a56">6</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="Speed" typeId="25d0e01e-8e74-55b3-8a2a-17773c881625">8″</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="Turn" typeId="899e9c58-70ef-5da5-8495-5bf6a8b7f8f0">45°</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="Crew" typeId="2f6312dd-493e-53c6-96e2-d901afca0e81">7</characteristic>
 </characteristics>
 </profile>
 <profile id="bc802ad3-a1f8-57c8-8aeb-f63113ac7aa7" name="Hardpoint Construction" hidden="true" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability">
 <characteristics>
 <characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Bare chassis. Every mounted weapon is purchased separately. No upgrade-spend ceiling. Legal choices are controlled by hull class, hardpoint type and facing; each hardpoint must contain exactly one weapon.</characteristic>
 </characteristics>
 </profile>
 <profile id="b73afbd7-4a27-4fbe-8ae7-d9b2e04c3b72" name="Mount Capacity" hidden="true" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Port: 3 · Starboard: 3 · Prow Ordnance: 3 · Dorsal: 3 · Defence: 6 · Hangar: 1</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="e88c892a-1494-410a-93b5-198857531271" name="Hardpoint Configuration" hidden="true" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Ships begin with no weapons or Defence Batteries selected. Hangar Bay slots represent built-in hull capacity and cost 0 pts. Each physical hardpoint may take at most one legal component. There is no separate upgrade-spend cap; the hull's mount layout is the limit.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="07ce6c24-fab1-406e-8b4e-a5560747208c" name="Roster Builder Summary" hidden="true" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Crew 7 · Port 3 · Starboard 3 · Prow Ordnance 3 · Dorsal 3 · Defence 6 · Hangars 1. Ships start unequipped. Fill only the weapon and Defence hardpoints you want to purchase; each may contain at most one component. Hangar Bay slots cost 0 pts. Aircraft are purchased separately up to Hangar capacity.</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles>
 <rules><rule id="7f75e7e7-722a-52a7-8265-9f7b4c78b3c5" name="Gets Hot" hidden="false"><description>After a Lance Turret or Twin Lance Turret resolves its attacks, roll a D6. On a 1 the firing ship loses 1 Hull Point. Each mount rolls separately.</description></rule><rule id="cb7e197f-cd49-5497-a44d-0fb967427d37" name="Capital" hidden="false"><description>Counts as a Capital Ship for every rule that names one, and fills a Capital slot.</description></rule><rule id="50b461e5-6a4e-55e9-8e18-e184d3d8ec0f" name="Reload (X)" hidden="false"><description>After firing, place X Reload tokens on the mount; flip one at the end of each battle round. The mount cannot fire while it bears a token.</description></rule><rule id="4c68085d-6df2-5b80-920a-88c3c1f6fa83" name="Devastating (X)" hidden="false"><description>Each hit costs X Hull Points, or 1 Void Shield Rating against live shields.</description></rule><rule id="322f3b28-6402-513c-b5c3-73da6509e08c" name="Armourbane" hidden="false"><description>Roll 2D6 + Strength to penetrate instead of 1D6, at 6″ or less, against shields or hull alike.</description></rule><rule id="3f720cd1-4f10-53ee-87b8-6f9975e69cdd" name="Point-Blank Broadsides" hidden="false"><description>At 6″ or less, Port, Starboard and Dorsal weapons improve AP by one step — or gain Armourbane instead if their printed AP is already 1. Prow weapons get neither.</description></rule><rule id="98e0b1ad-2215-5f8c-82d8-1e26acc6f080" name="Crippled" hidden="false"><description>Below half starting Hull Points: −1 BS and half Speed.</description></rule><rule id="35347765-44e7-5073-88fd-ec26f350b451" name="Depleted" hidden="false"><description>At half starting Crew or less: −1 BS. Stacks with Crippled.</description></rule><rule id="8caf4b4b-117e-50b1-8ffe-5f2d6dbd6705" name="Locked" hidden="false"><description>Joined by a ram. Neither ship may move; the rammer may not fire on its victim, who fires back at −1 BS. Break Away on 5+.</description></rule><rule id="aff559d1-f0f5-5e84-8dfa-b92c6c1afa98" name="Snap Shots" hidden="false"><description>Firing at BS 1 — hits only on a 6.</description></rule><rule id="2656e986-7fca-584a-afd8-109f81b9db1c" name="Wreck" hidden="false"><description>0 Hull Points without exploding. Becomes impassable, obscuring terrain; never moves and never Evades.</description></rule><rule id="df4885bc-daec-5bd3-9444-2d0c6ca77c38" name="Held station" hidden="false"><description>Moved 1″ or less under Burn Retros. Broadsides fire at +1 BS; −1 on Evade.</description></rule></rules><categoryLinks>
 <categoryLink id="37435d2f-53f4-5d13-94bc-4a16d155ff92" name="Capital" hidden="false" targetId="bd422ebf-10b3-5085-89cc-263568c40fe0" primary="true" />
 </categoryLinks>
 <selectionEntryGroups>
 <selectionEntryGroup name="Prow Mounts" id="2f8c1f8d-7612-5e5c-ae54-350e1bbf85e1" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><constraints><constraint type="max" value="2.0" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="false" id="fae32ce4-889d-5f21-878c-2c1281a3720a" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /></constraints><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="5e89272e-9d6f-53ba-8f63-4840e44893e8" name="Torpedo Tube" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="upgrade"><constraints><constraint type="max" value="2.0" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="false" id="a4ca230a-78fa-5ad0-aec8-f902e2c054a0" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" /></constraints><profiles><profile id="408a19b9-353c-53fe-b589-5bd2701dc2ad" name="Torpedo Tube" hidden="false" typeId="9e230bf6-0ca5-5105-b10d-a29e26b36da4" typeName="Weapon"><characteristics><characteristic name="Mount" typeId="a7d4d3c1-fadb-52b5-b9c2-4ca7010a2a7f">Prow</characteristic><characteristic name="Str" typeId="909e3bc8-34f7-50eb-8079-4e717af82c39">9</characteristic><characteristic name="AP" typeId="1086c466-d9ef-5b28-afb0-8d806ff0f9c2">2</characteristic><characteristic name="Shots" typeId="f85124c6-e75b-574a-befd-08cd1968bedf">1</characteristic><characteristic name="Range" typeId="f06bbe8e-b4ee-55fe-a54c-c6fda727a7fd">60″</characteristic><characteristic name="Special" typeId="59853d0d-663c-56dc-9957-cd236b62b380">One torpedo per tube. Bypasses Void Shields; Armourbane within 6″; Reload (2)</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="570b7f63-4fc7-515c-9c96-5b5c25501f85" value="10.0" /></costs></selectionEntry></selectionEntries></selectionEntryGroup><selectionEntryGroup name="Dorsal Mounts" id="094f1a46-a5f5-53bf-a8b2-3cfbdcd2a82d" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><constraints><constraint type="max" value="3.0" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="false" id="1f8513