 <selectionEntry id="b5018c3a-0374-56d0-961a-16fd2b7e7827" name="Battle Barge" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" type="unit">
 <constraints><constraint type="max" value="3.0" field="selections" scope="roster" shared="false" id="7d6c3f00-f704-532a-8f25-2b696ff5f808" percentValue="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="true" /></constraints><profiles>
 <profile id="1fa01433-113f-50cf-bf69-6f9d4d563569" name="Battle Barge" hidden="false" typeId="806f9ff1-fd51-5ddb-b005-ce73a5d09d65" typeName="Ship">
 <characteristics>
 <characteristic name="BS" typeId="d130e705-611e-5a0a-bd7d-ea8e848fdb2e">3</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="Prow" typeId="84a55377-edbc-5825-a2bf-70c6155018f2">13</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="Side" typeId="5f595433-7397-5c4b-9d4a-8f35d83a2b29">12</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="Stern" typeId="cd9ec76e-f959-5560-8845-9ab242f16e71">11</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="HP" typeId="ef713781-2034-5fb4-83d1-e49d1d683694">10</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="VS" typeId="84309751-688d-50ef-8940-d8d042261a56">7</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="Speed" typeId="25d0e01e-8e74-55b3-8a2a-17773c881625">9″</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="Turn" typeId="899e9c58-70ef-5da5-8495-5bf6a8b7f8f0">45°</characteristic>
 <characteristic name="Crew" typeId="2f6312dd-493e-53c6-96e2-d901afca0e81">9</characteristic>
 </characteristics>
 </profile>
 <profile id="325e78f8-af80-5db8-9b41-8d5a2ea89123" name="Astartes Crew" hidden="false" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability">
 <characteristics>
 <characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">All Crew count as Legiones Astartes (+1), free; may commit up to full current Crew in a Hull Assault, keeping 1 aboard.</characteristic>
 </characteristics>
 </profile>
 <profile id="40557d6b-5e48-5a70-8c12-e6211d3488c3" name="Boarding Forces Validation" hidden="true" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability">
 <characteristics>
 <characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Boarding forces are bought against the ship’s Crew. Terminator/Dreadnought class limits are enforced; remember a Contemptor occupies 2 Crew slots.</characteristic>
 </characteristics>
 </profile>
 <profile id="e6c1907f-3d5b-5a73-8a9c-f4ba00a48cb8" name="Hardpoint Construction" hidden="true" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability">
 <characteristics>
 <characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Bare chassis. Every mounted weapon is purchased separately. No upgrade-spend ceiling. Legal choices are controlled by hull class, hardpoint type and facing; each hardpoint must contain exactly one weapon.</characteristic>
 </characteristics>
 </profile>
 <profile id="239277bf-0ed9-4cdf-b99f-00a93a235d6f" name="Mount Capacity" hidden="true" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Port: 3 · Starboard: 3 · Prow Weapon: 1 · Prow Assault: 4 · Defence: 6 · Hangar: 2</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="40b82e2b-2903-413d-9744-2bbc655ea723" name="Hardpoint Configuration" hidden="true" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Ships begin with no weapons or Defence Batteries selected. Hangar Bay slots represent built-in hull capacity and cost 0 pts. Each physical hardpoint may take at most one legal component. There is no separate upgrade-spend cap; the hull's mount layout is the limit.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="f6575e57-4a90-40b5-b604-f317dea95eae" name="Roster Builder Summary" hidden="true" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Crew 9 · Port 3 · Starboard 3 · Prow 1 · Prow Assault 4 · Defence 6 · Hangars 2. Ships start unequipped. Fill only the weapon and Defence hardpoints you want to purchase; each may contain at most one component. Hangar Bay slots cost 0 pts. Aircraft are purchased separately up to Hangar capacity.</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles>
 <rules><rule id="9c32eac3-bc83-5435-9994-5d147f59c83c" name="Gets Hot" hidden="false"><description>After a Lance Turret or Twin Lance Turret resolves its attacks, roll a D6. On a 1 the firing ship loses 1 Hull Point. Each mount rolls separately.</description></rule><rule id="7edb0593-6a3f-5133-9df4-4cd99b3fff7c" name="Capital" hidden="false"><description>Counts as a Capital Ship for every rule that names one, and fills a Capital slot.</description></rule><rule id="ed228c85-b58d-54d9-87f3-18828bcefdb5" name="Reload (X)" hidden="false"><description>After firing, place X Reload tokens on the mount; flip one at the end of each battle round. The mount cannot fire while it bears a token.</description></rule><rule id="3b11ec40-8494-5e3d-b96e-35322f661829" name="Devastating (X)" hidden="false"><description>Each hit costs X Hull Points, or 1 Void Shield Rating against live shields.</description></rule><rule id="0dd150b9-63d9-59e2-a40e-1f4eaa019506" name="Armourbane" hidden="false"><description>Roll 2D6 + Strength to penetrate instead of 1D6, at 6″ or less, against shields or hull alike.</description></rule><rule id="d210e61f-da8a-5eba-8b3a-ac576a8298cd" name="Point-Blank Broadsides" hidden="false"><description>At 6″ or less, Port, Starboard and Dorsal weapons improve AP by one step — or gain Armourbane instead if their printed AP is already 1. Prow weapons get neither.</description></rule><rule id="8ec10ecc-b7d2-5188-9b79-97ee5eaa3f6a" name="Crippled" hidden="false"><description>Below half starting Hull Points: −1 BS and half Speed.</description></rule><rule id="a27ac630-4885-55cc-a893-a00afc97c51d" name="Depleted" hidden="false"><description>At half starting Crew or less: −1 BS. Stacks with Crippled.</description></rule><rule id="75c5bb3d-1f85-5232-a5b8-19f9f8177feb" name="Locked" hidden="false"><description>Joined by a ram. Neither ship may move; the rammer may not fire on its victim, who fires back at −1 BS. Break Away on 5+.</description></rule><rule id="b355583e-1e22-5cb4-95ee-230c35a32a4c" name="Snap Shots" hidden="false"><description>Firing at BS 1 — hits only on a 6.</description></rule><rule id="f634001f-f534-56ce-8c11-de5b2fda6d1c" name="Wreck" hidden="false"><description>0 Hull Points without exploding. Becomes impassable, obscuring terrain; never moves and never Evades.</description></rule><rule id="b121557c-5c74-55e3-8375-4103db6690ef" name="Held station" hidden="false"><description>Moved 1″ or less under Burn Retros. Broadsides fire at +1 BS; −1 on Evade.</description></rule></rules><categoryLinks>
 <categoryLink id="49eb430d-973c-5239-9719-1e2d58da536d" name="Capital" hidden="false" targetId="bd422ebf-10b3-5085-89cc-263568c40fe0" primary="true" />
 </categoryLinks>
 <selectionEntryGroups>
