 <profile id="dd9ad759-ae1f-52c5-a653-2cb1e3a8c350" name="Gloriana Common Rules" hidden="false" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability">
 <characteristics>
 <characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">A Primarch’s Flagship: never suffers the Crippled −1 BS penalty; must be the Flagship; one per battle; games of 2,000+ points. Gloriana Reactors: once per battle, when VS would reach 0 it remains at 1. Dorsal Twin Lance Turrets fire into all arcs and never Gets Hot. Heavy Macrobatteries use Reload (1). Armament fixed: no Section 11b refits.</characteristic>
 </characteristics>
 </profile>
 <profile id="9898e628-e001-55e5-84d9-658a34dfd062" name="Inexorable" hidden="false" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability">
 <characteristics>
 <characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Once shields are down, 5+ invulnerable save against each hit that would damage hull. Hangar Bays (3).</characteristic>
 </characteristics>
 </profile>
 <profile id="cdcbb3eb-5732-5405-9b5d-466beda745a1" name="Boarding Forces Validation" hidden="true" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability">
 <characteristics>
 <characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Boarding forces are bought against the ship’s Crew. Terminator/Dreadnought class limits are enforced; remember a Contemptor occupies 2 Crew slots.</characteristic>
 </characteristics>
 </profile>
 <profile id="98b9f973-f111-5755-9e95-42212249f12e" name="Mount Capacity" hidden="true" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability">
 <characteristics>
 <characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Port: 7 | Starboard: 7 | Dorsal: 6 | All-round: 8 | Hangar Bays: 3. Mounts, not arbitrary refit counts, are the limiting factor for weapon configuration.</characteristic>
 </characteristics>
 </profile>
 <profile id="0a06014c-3341-44f2-a998-69e179ef073f" name="Commander Embarkation" hidden="true" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Choose exactly one Fleet Commander. This character is embarked aboard this Flagship.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="c98dfe90-9ecf-4673-ae9c-49b7f350f248" name="Retinue Eligibility" hidden="true" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">The Primarch Retinue slot may only be used when the Primarch is selected as this ship's Fleet Commander. Choose at most one named Character of the same Legion.</characteristic></characteristics></profile><profile id="5ab7b334-e13a-47eb-83e9-b8e4114e70c0" name="Roster Builder Summary" hidden="true" typeId="3ec9b61c-f3d1-5fe4-adb4-6104872812e1" typeName="Ability"><characteristics><characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Crew 10. Ships start unequipped. Fill only the weapon and Defence hardpoints you want to purchase; each may contain at most one component. Hangar Bay slots cost 0 pts. Aircraft are purchased separately up to Hangar capacity.</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles>
