 <characteristics>
 <characteristic name="Description" typeId="5e1f6242-764b-516f-9c81-5659b132c092">Primarch. The Fleet Obeys: friendly ships within 12″ ignore the first Critical Damage they would suffer each battle round. Friendly ships within 6″ improve all Armour Values by +1 to max 14. Demigod of War +3.</characteristic>
